# Second Brain — Environment Variables Reference
#
# 1. Cloudflare Worker local development (`wrangler dev`):
#    Copy `.dev.vars.example` to `.dev.vars` (Wrangler reads `.dev.vars`, not `.env`).
#    For production, run: `npx wrangler secret put AUTH_TOKEN`
AUTH_TOKEN=replace-with-a-strong-secret-token
# VECTORIZE_GRACE_MS=300000

# 2. Optional client-side environment variables for `integrations/claude-code-hooks/`:
#    Used by `session-start.js` and `session-end.js` when installed as Claude Code hooks.
# SECOND_BRAIN_URL=https://second-brain.your-subdomain.workers.dev
# SECOND_BRAIN_TOKEN=replace-with-your-auth-token
